FF14 Price World — third-party data notices

This package bundles derived data from the sources below. Runtime APIs are
called over the public internet and do not require an API key.

1. Chinese item names — data/items.zh.json
   Source: thewakingsands/ffxiv-datamining-cn
   https://github.com/thewakingsands/ffxiv-datamining-cn
   The upstream repository license applies to the derived names. Review that
   repository's LICENSE before redistributing this file.

2. World id to server name mapping — data/worlds.id.json
   Source: Universalis public API v2, endpoint /worlds
   https://universalis.app/

3. Market prices — runtime only, no data bundled
   Source: Universalis public API v2
   https://universalis.app/

4. English item name fallback — runtime only, no data bundled
   Source: xivapi v2
   https://v2.xivapi.com/

The World implementation targets the public Cortico world API and is intended
for use with Coopanion. Cortico and Coopanion have their own licenses; this
package does not copy code from either project.
